//- The highlight list on the home (§S11.3, `blog.highlight_tag`): the
//- newest four posts whose frontmatter `tags` contain the tag, each a title
//- with its date; the heading is the tag itself. No link to the tag page
//- (its URL is plugin data). Not rendered when no post has the tag.
if themeBlog.highlightPosts(pageLang({ meta })).length
    section.home-highlight
        h2= themeBlog.highlightTag()
        ul
            each item in themeBlog.highlightPosts(pageLang({ meta }))
                li
                    a(href=item.meta.href)= item.meta.title
                    if isoDate(item.meta.createdAt)
                        time(datetime=isoDate(item.meta.createdAt))= formatDate(item.meta.createdAt, pageLang(item))
